  "bodyHash": "h9XfrMniSjM=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_f847fd45-3424-4a86-a9f3-bd3ff2aaf332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"933\" height=\"437\"></p><p><strong>你是否一直想讓火槍與 Epic Fight 搭配使用，但它們卻沒有任何動作？別擔心，這個模組就是為了讓 Epic Fight 能與 ewewukek 的火槍模組相容而誕生。</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_ec4f8799-24c1-44f2-ab72-49cffcbea67a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></strong></p><p>這個模組為各種火槍類型新增了 5 套自訂動作集，並內建與 Ewewukek 的火槍模組及《Last Epoch 戰士》的相容性。此外，該模組也讓生物能正確使用火槍，而不僅僅是進行近戰攻擊。同時還附帶一套自訂盔甲。建議搭配此資源包一起使用本模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flintl0cks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flintl0cks</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_81bb9861-9439-4f75-8115-ca1ef71b215a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_939cf738-74ce-4b3e-987c-df515668bc3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_c675e2e4-f405-4b7c-83b8-1d844b19328f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_b668bce3-3a93-437c-929b-67e3b1c3577e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_69f30333-e38f-4928-873f-934bda08c1b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>鳴謝</h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_ec9bff0e-c75b-4daa-8b25-fef0c1149dc8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"198\">特別感謝 Yonchi、Forixiam 和 Arcane 協助我製作這個模組。</p>",
